[SPEAKER_02]: Yay, okay.

873
01:26:00,945 --> 01:26:04,768
[SPEAKER_02]: Do I have here a motion to adjourn?

874
01:26:04,788 --> 01:26:08,130
[SPEAKER_02]: Motion to adjourn.

875
01:26:09,051 --> 01:26:09,752
[SPEAKER_02]: I'll second it.

876
01:26:10,932 --> 01:26:11,953
[SPEAKER_02]: Okay.

877
